      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Bromoderma is a cutaneous reaction caused by the use of products containing bromide. In this report we describe a 2-month-old girl who was admitted to our institution with vegetative lesions on the face and scalp owing to the administration of a syrup containing sodium bromide."},
